B.a6O=new A.nD("Jocelyn has about 10 years of experience with pets. She brings the same calm, hands-on care to every visit, and she is the other half of the small team behind Brio. Between the two of us, your pet is never just another booking on a list.",null)
B.a6P=new A.nD("Ulysses has spent more than 19 years caring for dogs. He lives in an apartment, so he knows how to keep a dog happy, calm and well exercised without a big yard. Brio loves other dogs and is easy to be around, though like most Schipperkes he is a little protective and takes a moment to warm up to new people. That makes us patient with every shy or cautious pet that comes through our door.",null)
B.a6Q=new A.nD("Brio is the name of our own Schipperke, a little black dog with a big personality. It also means energy and spirit, which is what we hope your pet brings home after a stay with us.",null)
B.a6R=new A.nD("Brio is a rescue, too. Giving a dog a second chance taught us how much a safe, loving home matters, and it is a big part of why we love caring for animals. Every pet who stays with us gets that same kind of care.",null)
B.a6S=new A.nD("We keep things small on purpose. When you book with Brio, you are booking with us, not a big company. We get to know you and your pet, and we treat your home and your animal the way we would want ours treated.",null)
B.a6T=new A.nD("Brio is a small pet-sitting service run by two people who genuinely love animals. Dogs, cats, and all pets are family to us, and we have years of hands-on experience caring for them.",null)
